<!-- Verifier-owned road network. A straight 600 m road with THREE adjacent
     driving lanes on the right-hand side (-1, -2, -3) and a single driving
     lane on the left (1), so one network exercises every neighbour
     configuration a lane-change legality query has to distinguish:

       lane -1  : centre line to the left, driving lane to the right
       lane -2  : driving lane on both sides
       lane -3  : driving lane to the left, non-driving border to the right
       lane  1  : centre line to the right, non-driving border to the left

     The road marks are chosen to match: the -1|-2 and -2|-3 boundaries carry
     broken lines marked laneChange="both", the -3|-4 boundary and the left
     lane's outer boundary carry solid lines marked laneChange="none". -->
